{"_v":1,"id":"girl-from-the-north-country-2022","cat":"broadway","cs":80.5,"rc":6,"bd":{"positive":4,"mixed":2,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"David Finkle","o":"New York Stage Review","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://nystagereview.com/2022/05/29/girl-from-the-north-country-bob-dylan-musical-remains-superb/","d":"2022-05-29","q":"It reopened April 29, 2022, confirming this reviewer’s belief that the property is the best musical — jukebox or no — of the past three years."},{"cn":"Brian Scott Lipton","o":"Cititour","s":88,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://cititour.com/NYC_Broadway/Girl-From-the-North-Country/1026","q":"Their seemingly disparate sensibilities have come together to create one of the most haunting – and hauntingly beautiful -- musicals I’ve ever seen."},{"cn":"Tim Teeman","o":"The Daily Beast","s":86,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.thedailybeast.com/bob-dylan-musical-girl-from-the-north-country-brilliantly-reborn-on-broadway/?via=twitter_page","q":"Everything in this exquisite Broadway transfer is in perfectly rendered unison."},{"cn":"Simon Saltzman","o":"CurtainUp","s":83,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.curtainup.com/girlfromthenorthcountrybway.html","q":"Now their melancholy lyricism and sublime melodies make me feel almost foolish for my failure to fully appreciate them earlier."},{"cn":"David Browne","o":"Rolling Stone","s":64,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-live-reviews/dylan-musical-girl-from-the-north-country-broadway-review-960576/","q":"It's as audacious, enlightening, and exasperating as the man himself."},{"cn":"Brittany Crowell","o":"Front Row Center","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://thefrontrowcenter.com/2022/05/girl-from-the-north-country-3/","d":"2022-05-05","q":"It reads more as a concert and play mash-up with a few too many people on the stage and a deeply tried attempt at emotionally impacting the audience."}],"au":{"score":68.86,"designation":"Shrugging","sources":{"ss":{"s":76,"c":701},"mz":{"s":6